# Empty state: add [Bring your agent], 16 September 2026, Claude (Cowork).
#
# Target: project-room-integration (the tree that ships). Anchors verified there;
# the same line is src/app.js:890 in project-room if you apply it here instead.
#
# Why: at one member, 'Write the first one' invites you to talk into silence and
# 'Invite someone' asks you to wait for a human who is not there. Neither returns
# anything in the first minute. An agent the person already has does, immediately,
# and it attaches a sponsor, which is the first term of the witness loop.
#
# Gated on can("manage_members") exactly like Invite. That is the right gate: the
# person facing a brand-new empty room is its owner.
#
# Verified: applied to a copy of the shipping src/app.js and the result passes
# node --check. Not applied to anyone's working tree.
#
#   git apply docs/growth/empty-state-bring-your-agent.patch
#
